OL,4,BHamilton-Leclerc collision 'completely 
OL,5,Bunacceptable'                          
OL,6,GFerrari drivers Lewis Hamilton and     
OL,7,GCharles Leclerc face yet another tense 
OL,8,Gdiscussion over their ability to race  
OL,9,Gtogether cleanly on track after        
OL,10,Gcolliding in the Las Vegas Grand Prix. 
OL,12,FLeclerc tipped Hamilton into a spin    
OL,13,Fwith 22 laps to go, costing both       
OL,14,Fpoints in a race where at one stage    
OL,15,Fthey were racing with the McLarens,    
OL,16,Fwho finished on the podium.            
OL,18,FLeclerc was given a 10-second penalty  
OL,19,Ffor the incident, which meant he       
OL,20,Ffinished 10th, three places behind     
OL,21,FHamilton, in a race won by Red Bull's  
OL,22,FMax Verstappen.                        
